明禮傳，贍於文辭。起家為本國右常侍，桓玄大將軍行參軍。玄篡位，以為尚書祠部郎。義熙初，又為尚書中兵郎，遷參高祖車騎中軍軍事，丹陽丞，中軍太尉主簿，出為山陰令，有能名。預討盧循功，封都亭侯。又為高祖鎮西、平北、太尉參軍，尚書左丞，本郡大中正。宋臺建，除御史中丞，為僚友所憚。准之父訥之、祖臨之、曾祖彪之至准之，四世居此職。准之嘗作五言，范泰謿之曰：「卿唯解彈事耳。」准之正色答：「猶差卿世載雄狐。」坐世子右衞率謝靈運殺人不舉免官。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":2,"surface":"准之","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0000","person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作准。"},{"start":21,"end":23,"surface":"桓玄","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0021","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作桓。"},{"start":30,"end":31,"surface":"玄","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0030","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作桓。"},{"start":88,"end":90,"surface":"盧循","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0088","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA**A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作盧。"},{"start":134,"end":136,"surface":"僚友","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:u0134","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"未具名同僚"},{"start":139,"end":141,"surface":"准之","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0139","person_id":"72e_1a7_3ac","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作准。"},{"start":142,"end":144,"surface":"訥之","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0142","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作訥。"},{"start":146,"end":148,"surface":"臨之","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0146","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBBB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作臨。"},{"start":151,"end":153,"surface":"彪之","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p002:m0151","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB","kind":"person","